%%{init: {'theme': 'dark', 'themeVariables': {'lineColor': '#000000', 'actorLineColor': '#000000', 'signalColor': '#000000', 'signalTextColor': '#000000'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant PD as ProjectDetailPage (React)
    participant VL as VulnerabilityList (React)
    participant PSvc as project.service.ts
    participant SSvc as scan.service.ts
    participant PA as projectApi (axios)
    participant SA as scanApi (axios)
    participant PC as ProjectController
    participant PS as ProjectService
    participant SCl as ScanServiceClient (RestTemplate)
    participant SCC as ScanController
    participant SS as ScanService
    participant VR as VulnerabilityRepository (JPA)
    participant DB as MySQL

    User->>PD: Open a project
    Note over PD: useEffect calls fetchProjectData, three requests run in parallel with Promise.all

    par project details
        PD->>PSvc: getProject(projectId)
        PSvc->>PA: GET /api/projects/{id} with Bearer JWT
        PA->>PC: JwtAuthenticationFilter validates, userId claim to request attribute
        PC->>PS: getProjectById(id, userId)
        PS->>PS: requireOwnedProject (403 if not owner)
        PS->>SCl: getVulnerabilitiesByProjectId(id) - JWT read from current request
        SCl->>SCC: GET /api/scans/projects/{id}/vulnerabilities (Bearer JWT)
        SCC->>SS: getVulnerabilitiesForProject(id)
        SS->>VR: findLatestByProjectId(id)
        VR->>DB: latest COMPLETED scan per repository only
        DB-->>VR: rows
        SS-->>SCC: List of VulnerabilityDTO (with AiSuggestionDTO)
        SCC-->>SCl: 200 JSON
        SCl-->>PS: counts feed vulnerabilityCount and criticalCount
        PS-->>PD: ProjectResponseDTO
    and repositories
        PD->>PSvc: getRepositories(projectId)
        PSvc->>PA: GET /api/projects/{id}/repositories
        PA-->>PD: repository list
    and vulnerabilities
        PD->>SSvc: getVulnerabilitiesByProject(projectId)
        SSvc->>SA: GET /api/scans/projects/{id}/vulnerabilities with Bearer JWT
        SA->>SCC: authenticated request (scan-service JwtAuthenticationFilter)
        SCC->>SS: getVulnerabilitiesForProject(id)
        SS->>VR: findLatestByProjectId(id)
        VR-->>SS: vulnerabilities with ai_suggestions
        SS-->>PD: List of VulnerabilityDTO
    end

    PD-->>User: Render tabs, repositories, and vulnerability list
    PD->>VL: pass vulnerabilities
    VL-->>User: Severity badges, confidence percentage, AI suggestion text

    opt User changes a vulnerability status
        User->>VL: choose new status
        VL->>SSvc: updateVulnerabilityStatus(vulnId, status)
        SSvc->>SA: PATCH /api/scans/vulnerabilities/{id}/status?status=
        SA->>SCC: authenticated request
        SCC->>SS: updateVulnerabilityStatus(id, status)
        SS->>DB: UPDATE vulnerabilities SET status
    end

    alt token expired or invalid on any call
        SA-->>PD: 401 - response interceptor clears session and redirects to /login
    end
